{"unit_id":"tag:042T:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是概形（scheme），<MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 上的代数空间（algebraic space）。假设 <MATH_0004> 是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），覆盖 <MATH_0005>。则存在细化（refinement）<MATH_0006>，它细化 <MATH_0007>，且是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering），其中每个 <MATH_0008> 都是概形（scheme）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"细化"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基底及所求覆盖成员；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic space","target_term":"代数空间","context":"被覆盖对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"给定与所求覆盖；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"细化","context":"两覆盖之间的关系；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:042T:proof","translation":"略。提示：对每个 <MATH_0001>，选择概形（scheme）<MATH_0002> 及满射（surjective）的平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0003>。然后检查 <MATH_0004> 是 fppf 覆盖（fppf covering）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"所选对象；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"所选态射性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"所选态射性质；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"所选映射；暂译待决。"},{"source_term":"fppf covering","target_term":"fppf 覆盖","context":"需要检查的族；暂译待决。"}],"notes":[]}
